  displayName: Blue shark
  scientificName: Prionace glauca
  description: A graceful open-ocean shark recognized by its deep blue coloration,
    long pectoral fins, and streamlined body. Blue sharks are highly migratory predators
    that roam vast distances across temperate and tropical oceans.
